text":"The writer","x":0.09251187535679041,"y":0.53749747464938491,"w":0.072177895439995685,"h":0.01076086499440243},{"w":0.2901234605577257,"h":0.013099648701714206,"x":0.092592592183414188,"y":0.55087209346759003,"text":"A informs readers how to get to each city"},{"text":"B mentions both positive and negative things","x":0.092592598488739283,"y":0.56540697674266593,"h":0.011627906907110019,"w":0.32098765055338541},{"y":0.57994186030613493,"text":"in each city.","x":0.10699588430271227,"w":0.08641975402832032,"h":0.011627906907110019},{"w":0.31481479220920139,"x":0.092592604641284063,"h":0.013090522173248242,"y":0.59301412859971414,"text":"C recommends both cities for people to visit."},{"w":0.047325100368923609,"x":0.090534981194138983,"h":0.010210926903286066,"text":"Text 2","y":0.61773255818756789},{"h":0.012363314067175835,"text":"Boytraveller23","y":0.63189973822068435,"w":0.10098776923285589,"x":0.092510231616810254},{"text":"A thinks Athens and Machu Picchu are both","y":0.64678178955831389,"w":0.30864196777343755,"h":0.010204081632653073,"x":0.090534987049495169},{"x":0.10905349760094162,"y":0.66130298275504329,"text":"good cities to visit.","h":0.011773940345368827,"w":0.13168724060058595},{"y":0.67582417598315714,"h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.092592599093029165,"text":"B believes that Athens is a better city to visit","w":0.3127571953667535},{"w":0.13991768731011284,"y":0.68877551029605255,"x":0.10699588652327012,"h":0.011805885066417221,"text":"than Machu Picchu."},{"x":0.09259259595715176,"w":0.27366255018446184,"h":0.011819575607683097,"text":"C agrees that Machu Picchu is the best","y":0.70329670336912775},{"w":0.1358024681939019,"text":"ancient city to visit.","h":0.010263407436233107,"x":0.10699588750798726,"y":0.7193877551126332},{"h":0.0090691287251806196,"y":0.74255845877439397,"w":0.047451286315917982,"text":"Text 3","x":0.090471887113633923},{"x":0.092492226241281644,"w":0.26150154961480032,"h":0.011781229516213521,"y":0.75576688053741936,"text":"Ayla Badem thinks visitors to Istanbul"},{"w":0.30294169108072916,"h":0.018432382886039211,"text":"A can find it hard to climb to the top of the","x":0.092386881774009236,"y":0.76565093124194827},{"text":"Galata Tower.","h":0.010249716894967231,"y":0.78488372110423466,"x":0.10905350140062368,"w":0.094650200737847232},{"w":0.30452674018012149,"h":0.013343799058084693,"x":0.092592600348896589,"y":0.79788069065907863,"text":"B should go to the Blue Mosque while they"},{"y":0.8138691753163283,"w":0.070007599724663624,"text":"are there.","x":0.10697150761331838,"h":0.010343044855905315},{"h":0.013343799058084804,"text":"C usually enjoy the cafés and restaurants","x":0.092592590067863759,"y":0.82692307670588683,"w":0.28600823296440975},{"text":"more than old buildings.","w":0.17078189425998266,"x":0.10905350016081791,"h":0.011773940345368938,"y":0.84144426985031762},{"x":0.06790123469898364,"w":0.028806584676106778,"y":0.95348837245268869,"h":0.014534882885320566,"text":"88"},{"h":0.011773940345368938,"y":0.068288854145448274,"x":0.46707818894565417,"w":0.053497941758897605,"text":"4) 3.32"},{"text":"Text 1","x":0.53497942413580235,"h":0.013343799058084804,"y":0.06671899503775014,"w":0.05555555555555558},{"text":"THE GREATEST","h":0.037790696699540716,"y":0.094476744754234843,"x":0.46296296898768841,"w":0.49794236924913193},{"x":0.4691358031180074,"h":0.042151162163990397,"w":0.4917695448133681,"text":"CITIES in the world?","y":0.13808139545143505},{"x":0.48148148006948455,"y":0.56671899478589172,"w":0.41769548204210072,"text":"Machu Picchu, Reru","h":0.027864992150706369},{"h":0.013081394896215293,"text":"Machu Picchu sits on top of a mountain 2,430 metres high","x":0.48148149727466716,"y":0.59883720969215393,"w":0.4300411309136285},{"text":"and the views are amazing! The Incas built the city around","y":0.6161695447962392,"w":0.4300411309136285,"x":0.48148148678084013,"h":0.011773940345368938},{"x":0.48353909501840586,"text":"1450, but they abandoned it 100 years later. In 1911 the","w":0.41358025444878477,"h":0.013088240541131779,"y":0.63226059636918508},{"y":0.6482558141896072,"text":"explorer Hiram Bingham discovered it again. Now, it's a popular","x":0.4794238751517087,"w":0.47119340684678823,"h":0.014617026881483031},{"x":0.47942387023554034,"y":0.66562009385242416,"text":"destination for tourists - around 1 million people visit the ruins","w":0.45679012722439238,"h":0.013343799058084804},{"x":0.48353909847628102,"w":0.45679012722439233,"y":0.68168604671977029,"text":"every year. It became a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1983.","h":0.013081394896215293},{"x":0.48148148948326591,"y":0.69897959197752313,"w":0.46502054850260416,"text":"Try to arrive on foot - there are organized three-day and seven-","h":0.011776221977485402},{"y":0.71507064358680628,"w":0.46296295166015622,"h":0.013127030532812944,"text":"day walks with a guide. If you're not feeling very active, you can","x":0.48353910493123864},{"text":"also get there by bus or by train.","y":0.73255813956970084,"h":0.011627906907110019,"w":0.24074072943793401,"x":0.48148149114523042},{"y":0.77325581390506315,"w":0.12757201300726989,"h":0.015988372371559811,"x":0.46913580260130333,"text":"COMMENTS"},{"h":0.011773940345368938,"text":"Text 2","y":0.77904238608215459,"w":0.051440327962239518,"x":0.63991769573375379},{"h":0.013081394896215404,"text":"I enjoyed your article Jan, but if you like ancient cities, then","y":0.80523255829317142,"x":0.55555556880172152,"w":0.38271603054470482},{"x":0.56995885690654735,"y":0.82103610660233672,"w":0.35185184054904517,"h":0.010359241973661337,"text":"Athens in Greece is a much better choice than Machu"},{"text":"Picchu! It's easy to get to and has so many incredible","y":0.83712715864162046,"w":0.33950615776909721,"h":0.011773940345368938,"x":0.57201647409899037},{"text":"monuments and museums. The Acropolis is spectacular","y":0.85164835183967891,"w":0.36831275092230897,"h":0.014630717422748907,"x":0.57201646772814585},{"text":"and it's got great views too! Its name means 'high city. O","x":0.56995884695175869,"h":0.011780785616001821,"y":0.86773255824702644,"w":0.36419752332899302},{"x":0.56359918088685768,"y":0.88054825034441087,"h":0.015312998785141696,"text":"There's a wonderful bazaar in Monastiraki Area. Syntagma","w":0.37894304063585071},{"text":"Square is a lovely place to enjoy a coffee and watch the","w":0.36008229573567707,"y":0.89825581402464261,"h":0.01162790690711013,"x":0.54320987643771712},{"w":0.43621398925781246,"text":"world go by. Athens also has wonderful restaurants and shops, and","x":0.49176954421883051,"y":0.91405023543249508,"h":0.011821857614083053},{"x":0.49176955656225874,"y":0.92877906972958468,"text":"a fantastic nightlife. @Boytraveller23","w":0.23662550184461806,"h":0.011627906907110019}]